      "value": "clinical features such as stiffness/spasms/hyperlordosis, positive antibodies such as anti-GAD, EMG showing continuous motor-unit activity, response to benzodiazepines",
      "quote": "SPS is an uncommon autoimmune disorder of the central nervous system, characterized by progressive rigidity and episodic painful spasms. Classical SPS in adulthood is characterized by a chronic, slowly progressive clinical course over months or years, frequently with anti-GAD antibodies and psychiatric symptoms such as anxiety disorders.",
